ankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T22:44:44-08:00","id":394506,"title":"","content":"Alternatively, to the game that was originally intended to be WW's sci-fi game, Mark Rein-Hagen's Exile, which Aeon replaced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T04:48:44-08:00","id":394685,"title":"","content":"This is the first time I've heard of Exile. I am pretty sure there were further commercials for Trinity in the same design as the one in 1997. Do you know anything more about it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T06:04:54-08:00","id":394717,"title":"","content":"Exile was a space opera game where you play someone who's been kicked out of a utopia-cum-dystopia into the galaxy at large, only to find the galaxy at large is dangerous as hell.<br /> <br /> According to Andrew Bates, Aeon/Trinity's first developer, he was slated to finish developing Exile after Mark's concept work was done, then internal company stuff happened, and Mark hung onto Exile* and WW needed something else for Exile's proposed launch window - what became Aeon/Trinity, which needed to be done super-fast thanks to having lost development time on Exile.<br /> <br /> * from info elsewhere, Mark left WW, taking Exile with him.<br /> <br /> A <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/19970127032446/http://null-f.org/rules/exile1_0.html\" target=\"_blank\">HTML playtest draft</a> can be found here, and a <a href=\"http://www.angelfire.com/zine/technacothaka/rpg/exile_1_1st_draft.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF playtest draft</a> here. Note that it's not a complete game by a long shot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}